                      <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 mt-1">If set, the Play button will redirect to this URL instead of the internal player. For Plex, use the base web URL including your machine identifier.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="space-y-2">
                      <label id="new-conn-token-label" for="new-conn-token" class="block text-sm font-medium text-zinc-400">Token</label>
                      <div class="relative">
